@startuml deployment-compose
title PushTalk — docker compose topology

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 55
top to bottom direction

actor Browser

rectangle "docker compose (project: pushtalk)" {
  node "**web**\nnginx:1.30-alpine\nport 8080" as web

  rectangle "image pushtalk-api (apps/api, target api; ffmpeg included)" as img {
    node "**api**\nuvicorn pushtalk.main:app" as api
    node "**worker**\ncelery worker -Q audio" as worker
    node "**flower**\ncelery flower\nport 5555, basic auth" as flower
    node "**migrate** (one-shot)\nalembic upgrade head" as migrate
  }
  node "**transcriber**\nimage pushtalk-transcriber\n(target transcriber: + faster-whisper,\nbase model baked in)\ncelery worker -Q transcribe" as transcriber

  database "**postgres**\npostgres:16-alpine" as pg
  queue "**redis**\nredis:7-alpine\nappendonly yes" as redis
}

rectangle "volumes" {
  storage pgdata
  storage redisdata
  storage media
  storage "whisper-models" as whispermodels
}

Browser --> web : :8080
Browser --> flower : 127.0.0.1:5555
web --> api : /api, /ws
img --> pg
img --> redis
transcriber --> pg
transcriber --> redis
api --> media
worker --> media
transcriber ..> media : read only
pg --> pgdata
redis --> redisdata
transcriber ..> whispermodels

legend bottom
  **Start order** (depends_on): postgres and redis healthy → migrate finishes → api, worker, transcriber, flower → api healthy → web
  **media:** uploads and processed Opus files, shared by api, worker and transcriber (read only).
  **whisper-models:** starts as a copy of the image's base model; other sizes are downloaded here on first use.
  **docker-compose.dev.yml** adds: postgres :5433 and redis :6380 on localhost, api :8001 with uvicorn --reload,
  worker and transcriber restarted on code change (watchfiles); `pnpm dev` (:5173) proxies to the api.
endlegend
@enduml
